        <briefdescription>
<para>Decode an OSC 1337 <ref refid="classFile" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">File</ref>= payload into an <ref refid="structterminal_1_1_image_sequence" kindref="compound">ImageSequence</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>data</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Raw OSC payload bytes (everything after &quot;1337;&quot;). Expected to begin with &quot;File=&quot;. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>length</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of bytes. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_image_sequence" kindref="compound">ImageSequence</ref> with RGBA8 pixels for all frames, or invalid if decode fails or inline=0.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>READER THREAD only.</para>
</simplesect>
Parse steps:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Validate and skip the &quot;File=&quot; prefix.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Scan key=value params up to the &apos;:&apos; delimiter, extracting <computeroutput>inline</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Return invalid when <computeroutput>inline != 1</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Base64-decode everything after &apos;:&apos;.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Attempt native multi-frame decode via <computeroutput><ref refid="namespaceterminal_1ab8471c5f4a063b7f05350297f06c862f" kindref="member">loadImageSequenceNative</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If native decode fails, fall back to JUCE <computeroutput><ref refid="classImageFileFormat_1a1ce6ae82e06b40e9149d1ab73951ce1c" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">ImageFileFormat::loadFrom</ref></computeroutput> followed by <computeroutput><ref refid="namespaceterminal_1a7b9c9dd44feef553c5420b76fc8d54ad" kindref="member">swizzleARGBToRGBA</ref></computeroutput> to produce a single-frame sequence.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Return the <ref refid="structterminal_1_1_image_sequence" kindref="compound">ImageSequence</ref>.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>data</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Raw OSC payload bytes after &quot;1337;&quot;. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>length</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of bytes. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_image_sequence" kindref="compound">ImageSequence</ref> with RGBA8 pixels, or invalid on any failure.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>READER THREAD only. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
