    <briefdescription>
<para>Decodes an OSC 1337 <ref refid="classFile" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">File</ref>= payload into a multi-frame RGBA8 <ref refid="structterminal_1_1_image_sequence" kindref="compound">ImageSequence</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Parses the <computeroutput><ref refid="classFile" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">File</ref>=</computeroutput> key=value header, validates <computeroutput>inline=1</computeroutput>, base64-decodes the image data, and delegates to <computeroutput><ref refid="namespaceterminal_1ab8471c5f4a063b7f05350297f06c862f" kindref="member">loadImageSequenceNative</ref></computeroutput> for image decoding. A JUCE-based fallback handles formats the native codec does not support.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Constructed and used on the READER THREAD only. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
